        {
          "path": "_m/w/9/n/z/pasonanca-park-wp/pasonanca-protected-park.jpg",
          "filename": "Pasonanca Protected Park.jpg",
          "caption": "Pasonanca Park, a protected area situated in Zamboanga City, Philippines is widely recognized for its beauty, lush green landscapes and rich biodiversity. Located in the northern part of Zamboanga City, on Mindanao Island this expansive park spans 170 hectares and serves as an important green space within the city. Pasonanca Park boasts an array of plant and animal species, including bird species, butterflies and other wildlife. Visitors can immerse themselves in the parks maintained trails while indulging in birdwatching or capturing natures beauty through photography. The parks flourishing forests, rolling hills and vibrant plant life all contribute to its captivating appeal as an escape, from the city life.",
